"Read the following part request and produce a formal CAD brief that captures every stated dimension, feature, and constraint without adding or omitting requirements.\n\nPart request: \"Make an L-bracket from 5 mm thick aluminum. The base is 80 mm long and 40 mm wide. The upright is 60 mm tall and 40 mm wide. There are two 6 mm diameter holes in the base, centered 10 mm from each end along the length and centered across the width. There is one 6 mm diameter hole in the upright, centered 10 mm from the top and centered across the width. All holes are through-holes. The bracket must be watertight and match these dimensions within 0.5 mm.\""